  "body": "Not to be confused with the Transfer() abstract op that invokes it.\r\n\r\nAfter https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2145#issuecomment-265548208 I was wondering, is Transfer() having `data-dfn-type=\"abstract-op\"` enough to disambiguate between the two? What's the actual impact of adding it/leaving it out, and should there be a separate type for `\"internal-method\"` or `\"internal-slot\"`?",
